        "user_title": "",
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Is it a</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\"When a Device is dealt damage, if it is the first time <strong><em>that</em></strong> <em>Device</em> has been dealt damage this turn, this card deals...\"</p>\r\n\r\n<p>or is it a</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\"When a Device is dealt damage, if it is the first time <strong><em>any</em></strong> <em>Device</em> has been dealt damage this turn, this card deals...\"</p>\r\n\r\n<p>?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I'm guessing the latter, because otherwise some villains can really incinerate themselves.</p>",
